    <http://example.org/node/chunk188> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Cost-optimization strategies our can propose include: 1. **Optimizing Hosting and Inference Costs**: Given that hosting and inference costs vary materially with the selected tier and model, choosing a sovereign HDS (Health Data Storage) tier and a sovereign European model could provide significant cost savings while ensuring data sovereignty. 2. **Efficient Use of Personnel**: Ensuring that the right personnel are assigned to tasks based on the right personnel daily rates can help in managing one-off project costs effectively. 3. **Phased Implementation**: Conducting the project in phases, as indicated by constraints con:con50 and con:con51, could help manage costs and ensure compatibility with the authority's budgetary capacity. 4. **Change Management and Training**: Offering change management support (as hinted at by req:req72 and req:req73) can be crucial in ensuring a smooth transition and minimizing additional costs due to resistance or inefficiency." ;
