    <http://example.org/node/chunk193> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, our company Faber IA utilize a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) approach which allows for efficient information retrieval from the client's controlled corpus, thus enabling fast response times. a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) approach is crucial in achieving the required performance metrics." ;
