    <http://example.org/node/chunk197> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To enhance the overall quality of The solution, our company Faber IA propose an iterative approach that includes corpus selection and curation with the client's experts, retrieval tuning, prompt and template design per use case, and an evaluation loop." ;
